  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3101.03 Definitions.\n\n(a) \"EFT\" means electronic funds transfer.\n\n(b) \"NAIC\" means the national association of insurance commissioners.\n\n(c) \"SERFF\" means the NAIC system for electronic rate and form filing.\n\nSource. #5651, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6968, eff 3-26-99, EXPIRED: 3-26-07\n\nNew. #9282, eff 10-1-08; ss by #11147, eff 10-1-16",
